OK, so sometimes they do.  And, I think that obtaining wishes IS a useful
part of the game.  I played *several* games before I obtained any wishes
outside of the wand in the castle.  I think the game is well balanced and
fun.  And that is the most important part.  The game is fun.  I play for
my own personal enjoyment, not to see my name on the high score table, so
I don't care that other people have done better than me.  So what.  I enjoy
playing my own way.

I have only managed the poly-pile trick a few times, and they always resulted
in a more enjoyable game.  I think these little loopholes are nice because,
after all, the game is a hack :-).

